cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Journal_Utilities"
abstract: >-
  Modular, config-driven pipeline for processing the Active Inference
  Institute video library: YouTube channel enumeration and download,
  local (mlx-whisper) and GPU (WhisperX) transcription with speaker
  diarization, Cohere-based entity extraction into a SurrealDB knowledge
  graph, multi-format export, and a FastAPI web interface with an
  Ollama-powered RAG chat engine. Also the code-side source of truth for
  the ActiveInferenceJournal v2 schema and its maintenance scripts.
